WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:41.240
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:47.120
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.210
<i>continue their adventure.</i>

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:56.130
<i>Starting with the real world's
rocket explosion,</i>

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:00.220
<i>something was about to happen
in the Digital World.</i>

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.020
<i>As Taichi and Agumon searched
for Hikari who was taken,</i>

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:11.610
<i>they witnessed a threat against Digimon
who lived peacefully in the jungle.</i>

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:21.740
<i>Taichi and Agumon fought together
with Sora and Garudamon, but...</i>

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.930
Shadow Wing!

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.790
Shadow... Wing!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.090
Garudamon!

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:20.420
I'm fine.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:23.260
That should be all of the Megadramon.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.760
<i>Taichi.</i>

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:26.810
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:29.390
Yeah, somehow.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:36.770
Let's hurry, Taichi.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.530
There's still more of them coming!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.540
VEGIMON

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:59.050
THE MEGA DIGIMON, WARGREYMON

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:03.550
It's here!

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:06.760
What is it?

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:10.020
I'm having my friend online
look up some things.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:10.890
Hm.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:15.150
<i>That rocket incident is probably
just the beginning...</i>

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:17.190
That's why...

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:20.940
It's the same every time!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.570
It won't accept any commands
from this side!

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:26.240
<i>There's trouble occurring...</i>

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.700
in satellites around the world.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:33.210
What a disaster! If this spreads...

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:37.040
The amount of data exchanged
across the world will increase

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.000
and stimulate networks.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.050
Eek!

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:42.970
If that happens...

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:48.260
<i>it'll stimulate Digimon just like
when the ships went out of control.</i>

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.020
That sounds awfully bad!

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.930
But how strange.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:59.480
It's true there's evidence
of orbits being altered.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.990
But currently,
there's no danger of any satellites

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.990
entering the atmosphere
or falling onto Earth.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:10.160
That's quite a relief, isn't it?

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.950
No, I must be overlooking something!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.250
Somewhere!

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:21.250
If we can pass through
the mountain cave up ahead,

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.260
we can escape to the other side.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:28.300
I'd say Garudamon could fly us over
if we need to cross over a mountain,

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:31.010
but we could get targeted from below.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:38.270
Sora, protect everyone, please.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.780
If they catch up to us inside the cave,
we can't escape.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:47.910
If all the enemies are out here,
me and Metalgreymon can stall them.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:48.780
Yeah.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.790
We'll meet you on the other side.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.040
All right.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.630
Giga Storm!

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:18.810
<i>Sora!</i>

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.360
Now's our chance. Let's hurry!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.090
They're following!

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.720
First, we'll lure them as we go.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.810
Something's coming!

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.770
That's not Megadramon!

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:05.940
A new enemy!

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.480
What do we do?

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:10.200
It'd be bad if Sora is spotted from above.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.660
Metalgreymon!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:12.870
Yeah!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.460
Good, come over here!

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.530
Ultimate Digimon, Parrotmon!

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:51.150
PARROTMON

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.410
What's the matter?!

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:05.000
So adjusting the orbit wasn't possible.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:08.170
But, these orbital paths are...

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:11.670
<i>There was no point in looking
at the orbits individually.</i>

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:17.140
The United States, Japan, India, Russia,
and China's artificial satellites.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:21.140
Eventually all orbital paths
will intersect at one point.

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.350
At that point is...

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:27.860
<i>the International Space Station!</i>

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:29.860
<i>W-W-What?!</i>

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:35.570
<i>If several satellites were to collide with
this giant International Space Station...</i>

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:41.200
<i>and if all the debris
fell onto Earth's surface...</i>

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:49.500
The impact would be the same as a meteor!
An immense amount of damage would occur!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.380
Oh, no!

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.590
Sparks again...

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.340
Metalgreymon!

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.220
Giga Storm!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:45.640
One more shot!

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.160
Dang it!

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:18.180
CROSSMON

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:20.800
An evolution!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:24.430
Beyond the Ultimate Digimon...
a Mega Digimon!

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:45.790
Giga Destroyer!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:56.150
Where are we going?

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:33.440
This is bad.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:38.480
Looks like Crossmon noticed Sora's group.

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:42.070
Agumon, you alive?

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:45.570
Yeah, somehow...

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:47.620
Taichi, are you okay?

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.620
Yeah, sort... of.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.370
Good...

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.250
That Digimon's super strong.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.630
Yeah...

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:58.750
But...

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:18.020
Hey, Agumon...

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:22.150
I think I'm starting to remember.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:29.780
When we fought Devimon, I was eaten.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.790
I lost consciousness.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:38.040
But in that moment, it felt like
I could hear you calling my name.

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:46.430
<i>Yeah, that's right.
I thought I lost you, Taichi.</i>

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.680
<i>So I think I lost my head.</i>

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.180
<i>But Taichi, you were alive.</i>

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:57.350
<i>You seemed to be calling me,
so I jumped out before I knew it.</i>

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:00.770
<i>And then... and then...</i>

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.320
<i>What happened?</i>

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:05.190
<i>Right, it's hard to explain,</i>

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:08.490
<i>but for now, we're still alive.</i>

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.200
<i>We can still move.</i>

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:11.200
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:15.700
<i>We still have a lot of things
to accomplish!</i>

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.080
<i>With everybody!</i>

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.920
<i>We don't have time to mope!</i>

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:22.800
<i>We can't be chickening out!</i>

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.420
We'll get back up again and again!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:30.720
Yeah! We'll dive back into battle
over and over!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.480
Let's do it, Agumon!

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:45.440
Okay, Taichi!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:08.720
Agumon Evolution!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.010
Greymon!

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:21.980
Mega Flame!

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:04.060
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.730
Metalgreymon!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.650
Trident Arm!

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.990
Giga Storm!

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:25.710
Giga Destroyer!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.430
Crossmon...

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.560
Metalgreymon!

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:41.890
Yeah!

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:31.790
Can you keep going, Metalgreymon?

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:39.260
Let's show what we got...

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:41.640
of our powers!

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:00.360
What is it?

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:21.220
Metalgreymon Mega Evolution!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:37.690
Wargreymon!

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.990
WARGREYMON

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:35.670
Gaia Force!

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:26.470
Taichi!

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:32.740
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:35.700
<i>Darkknightmon.</i>

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:38.870
<i>This Ultimate Digimon super evolves
from Skullknightmon.</i>

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:38.870
LEVEL: ULTIMATE

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:41.040
TYPE: DARK KNIGHT

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:43.300
<i>Darkknightmon is a tough, clever,
and driven dark knight.</i>

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:43.300
SPECIAL MOVE: TWIN SPEAR
SHOULDER BLADE / UNDEAD SOLDIER

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:45.260
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:50.470
<i>When I was typing into the encyclopedia,
"This Digimon is stylish after evolving,"</i>

00:22:50.640 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>Kabuterimon deleted the data after saying,
"I'm much more stylish!"</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:22:59.980
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:07.280
<i>An ancient Digimon awakens and saves
Taichi's group and the jungle's Digimon.</i>

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:11.620
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"A New Darkness, Millenniumon"</i>

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.700
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
